    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CME are delighted to present this very well maintained 3 bedroom bungalow to the market. Nestled in this extremely quiet and tranquil cul de sac, this lovely home benefits from a large converted attic as well as a spacious workshop with power to the rear. Lovingly maintained by the current owners, no.3 boasts a wide side entrance, offering excellent potential to expand (S.P.P) and a most wonderful botanical wonderland to the rear with the most stunning array of curated planting, ideal for the sunny Westerly facing garden. Meadow Court is within a few minutes' of Clane village street which offers a range of shops from homeware to coffee shops, hairdressers, post office and gastro pubs to name a few. The local primary and secondary schools, preschool and creche, as well as the GAA club, Clane Lawn Tennis Club, Swimming Pool and gym are within walking distance and within a few minutes' drive of Supermarkets, Tesco, Aldi, Lidl and Dunnes Stores. Viewing is highly recommended & by appointment with CME."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch: c. 1.0m x 1.4m\r\nLaminate wood floor. Alarm pad. Glazed door to ....\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: c. 5.9m x 1.2m\r\nLaminate wood floor. Hotpress. Coving to ceiling.\r\n\r\nLounge: c. 5.9m x 3.9m\r\nWide plank Laminate flooring. Coving to ceiling. Wood burning solid fuel stove insert on marble hearth with fireplace surround. Large window affording excellent light.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining: c. 4.9m x 3.9m\r\nRemodelled and recently refitted kitchen comprising excellent range of Peacock Blue fitted, shaker style floor units complimented by quartz counter tops and tiled splashback. Soft closing doors and pull out storage allowing excellent use of space with stainless steel extractor fan. Spotlights to ceiling. Tiled floor. Door to rear. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 4.0m x 2.8m\r\nRear Aspect. Laminate wood floor. Excellent range of built in wardrobes and dressing table.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.0m x 2.9m\r\nFront aspect. Laminate wood flooring. Built in wardrobes and dressing table.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 2.9m x 2.4m \r\nLaminate wood flooring. Side aspect. Stairs ascending to ...\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion: c. 3.2m x 7.9m\r\nCarpeted stairs and floor. 2 large velux windows. Spotlights to ceiling. Eaves storage. Extremely spacious proportions.\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 2.5m x 1.8m \r\nWith White suite comprising walk in bath with electric shower. Tiled floor & wet areas. Heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nOutside: To the front there is a driveway with parking for 2 cars, lawn area and hedged boundary. Wide side entrance (c.2.9m) leading to sunny West facing garden with a wonderful array of mature trees and planting including colourful perennials, fragrant climbers, acer and roses. Raised vegetable beds to side. Paved patio area and Greenhouse. Steel garden shed. Outside workshop with power and water (c.5.5 x 3.3m)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom Bungalow with converted attic\r\nPresented in very good condition\r\nQuiet & tranquil cul de sac setting location \r\nOverlooking green space\r\nWest facing rear garden\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nRecently remodelled & refitted kitchen\r\nWide side entrance c.2.9m \r\nSuperb gardens\r\nLarge front garden with parking for 2 cars\r\nWalking distance to Clane village \r\nWorkshop/Studio (plumbed for washing machine), with power-ideal for many uses"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
